== step 3: fabric widths (FROMHOST is a 64-bit pair: the low half lands with the high half)
$ tanager-host poke 0x68 0x12345678
$ tanager-host poke 0x6c 0x9abcdef0
$ tanager-host peek 0x68
0x12345678
$ tanager-host peek 0x6c
0x9abcdef0
$ tanager-host poke 0x68 0
$ tanager-host poke 0x6c 0
   and a 32-bit register (TG_LINES):
$ tanager-host poke 0xc8 0x2468
$ tanager-host peek 0xc8
0x00002468
$ tanager-host poke 0xc8 16384
